    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "All cause renal toxicity (often reversible), vestibular/auditory toxicity (often irreversible; vertigo, ataxia) and prolonged neuromusc blockade (can worsen myasthenia gravis). Risk rises w ↑ or freq doses, ↑levels, >3 days, older age, renal dz, other nephrotoxins (eg, vanco, contrast); loop diuretics add ototoxicity."
     }
    ]
   }
